<title>JAPAN: Nagasakiya -95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Nagasakiya -95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.51		vs	   12.81</p>
<p> Operating   loss 844    million	  vs   loss 305    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 971    million	  vs   loss 458    million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1.05		vs   loss 138    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 73.08 yen	  vs     loss 9.64 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nagasakiya Co Ltd (Osaka) is a medium-sized confectioner.</p>
</text>
